      "content": "<h3>Where Comparable sits</h3>\n<div style=\"display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; align-items:center; justify-content:center; gap:8px 4px; width:100%; font-size:12px; line-height:1.25;\">\n<div style=\"background:#eef7e9; border:1px solid #8fbf7f; border-radius:5px; padding:3px 8px; text-align:center; line-height:1.25;\"><strong style=\"font-size:12px; padding:0 5px;\">Comparable&lt;T&gt;</strong><br><span style=\"font-size:11px;\">(I)</span></div>\n<div style=\"display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:4px;\"><span style=\"font-size:11px; color:#b5651d; white-space:nowrap;\">&larr; implements</span><div style=\"background:#e6eefc; border:1px solid #7fa0d9; border-radius:5px; padding:3px 8px; text-align:center; line-height:1.25;\"><strong style=\"font-size:12px; padding:0 5px;\">String / Integer / LocalDate ...</strong><br><span style=\"font-size:11px;\">(c)</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:4px;\"><span style=\"font-size:11px; color:#3b6e3b; white-space:nowrap;\">&larr; implements</span><div style=\"background:#e6eefc; border:1px solid #7fa0d9; border-radius:5px; padding:3px 8px; text-align:center; line-height:1.25;\"><strong style=\"font-size:12px; padding:0 5px;\">Your class (Fort)</strong><br><span style=\"font-size:11px;\">(c)</span></div></div>\n</div>\n<p>(I) = interface, (c) = class. It is not part of the Collection hierarchy but sorted collections depend on it.</p>"
